    363  533a							; ------------------------------------------------------------ v0.61: the 25 beats
    364  533a							; Each beat's lanes say per step: A, B or both (beatsio.asm). The part
    365  533a							; (RUN/STOP N) picks which play; a hat layer (H) stands in for the beat's own
    366  533a							; hats, an accent layer (J) sets each step's level, the time signature (K)
    367  533a							; takes runs of the beat's steps (the cycle), swing (L) delays the off-beats.
    368  533a							; The hits go to the MidiNES (one sample, one noise sound: DrumHit) and / or
    369  533a							; Fat Chip GB (notes on its drum channel: two at once, its own hats), as the
    370  533a							; menu's BEATS ON / BOTH say.
    371  533a
    372  533a							; A = beat: chosen (RUN/STOP keys, the keytar's rhythm buttons). A beat that's
    373  533a							; playing keeps the tempo (Reeve, v0.61); stopped, BEAT TEMPO DEFAULT gives it
    374  533a							; its own.
